There are two types of speed: intrinsic speed and "item" speed.

The first is gained by various means, reaching level 7 for some classes
for example. Some classes even start out with it.

The "item" speed is gained by wearing speed boots.

There are several degrees of speed: very slow, slow, normal, fast, and
very fast. Every type of speed can increase your speed by one class. So
if you are wearing speed boots, you are fast. If you are ALSO
intrinsically sped up, you are VERY fast. You can become (very) slow if
you are burdened or by means of wands of slow monster zapped at you.

And about quantum mechanics: they TOGGLE your intrinsic speed: if you
are normal, you become fast, and if you are fast, you become normal. If
you are wearing speed boots, you toggle between fast and very fast.

